  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is a linear differential equation.</p><p>Integrating&nbsp;Factor&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Solution of the above equation is</p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
